sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Target app
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API
    participant M1 as Module 1
    participant M2 as Module 2 (extender)
    participant M3 as Module 3
    participant Act as Actuator

    loop every probe cycle (BUCKET_SECONDS)
        M1->>App: HTTP probe (latency)
        M1->>K8s: read CPU/memory metrics, replica count
        M1->>M1: predict_risk() -> predicted_risk
    end

    loop every control cycle (POLL_SECONDS)
        M3->>M1: GET /risk
        M3->>M2: GET /state (bandit posterior)
        M3->>M3: ACI update + PI step + oscillation widening
        M3->>M3: new adaptive threshold, alert?
    end

    loop every actuation cycle (ACT_INTERVAL_SECONDS)
        Act->>M1: GET /risk (signal)
        Act->>M3: GET /state (threshold)
        Act->>Act: band rule: signal > threshold -> +1,\nsignal < threshold*0.5 -> -1, else hold
        alt scale up
            Act->>K8s: PATCH replicas +1
            K8s->>App: new pod scheduled
            Note over K8s,M2: kube-scheduler calls Module 2's\n/filter + /prioritize for the new pod
        else scale down
            Act->>K8s: PATCH replicas -1
        else hold
            Act->>Act: no action
        end
    end
